      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: \n- 1st instance:\n\"Koh's home\" by Legends. Around 15 minutes into the community meetup.\nPlayer called \"1\" (who voted on this canny) had no nameplate. They're on my friends list.\nAt least 2 other players in the instance have reported not seeing another person's nameplate.\n- 2nd instance:\n\"duckling park\" by theironickitten. Around 2 hours into the community meetup.\nTwo players had no nameplate, simultaneously from my point of view:\nPlayer called \"Nosjo\" (who voted on this canny) had no nameplate. They're NOT on my friends list.\nPlayer called \"Skipper\" (who voted on this canny) had no nameplate. They're on my friends list.\nOther players in the instance have reported not seeing another person's nameplate.",
